  "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/3e3d8152a42569f114.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"דלעות\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/3e3d8152a42569f114.png\" width=\"213\" /></a></div></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">כשהַשֵּׂעָר הַסּוֹרֵר מוּסָר בִּסְעָרָה</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְגִלַּח אֶת כָּל-שְׂעָרוֹ</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַגְּבָרִים שֶׁל פַּעַם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא הִתְעַסְּקוּ בַּשֵּׂעָר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא רָאוּ בָּזֶה טַעַם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רַק דָּאֲגוּ לַמָּחָר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם צָנַח לוֹ תַּלְתַּל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹ נִפְרְעָה לָהּ קְוֻצָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא הֵזִיז לָהֶם בִּכְלָל,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מָה יַגִּידוּ בַּחֶבְרָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שְׂעָרוֹת - צָצוּ בְּכָל מָקוֹם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זְרוֹעוֹת, חֲזוֹת וְרַגְלַיִם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא הוּנַף סָדִין אָדֹם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְשֵׂעָר מְבַצְבֵּץ מֵאָזְנַיִם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי נָאֶה הוּא הַשֵּׂעָר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל יְדֵי אִישׁ שְׁזוּפוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּלָל לֹא מְיֻתָּר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּרַגְלֵי גֶּבֶר שְׁרִירִיּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ אֲבוֹי, בִּרְבוֹת הַיָּמִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">(עֵת פָּסְקוּ הַמִּלְחָמוֹת).</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תַּשּׁוּ הַזְּכָרִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָיוּ לִנְקֵבוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זְרוֹעוֹתֵיהֶם הִתְדַּלְדְּלוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִלְּעִסַּת נִבְטוּטִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּלוֹרִיּוֹתֵיהֶם נָשְׁרוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵרֹב הִרְהוּרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּהֶמְשֵׁךְ, הֵחֵלּוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְאַמֵּץ גִּנּוּנִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְחֶלְקָם אֲפִילּוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גִּהֵץ לְבָנִים!!!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שׁוֹמֵעַ? יָא גֶּבֶר אַלּוּף,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵין אִידֵאָל/פּוֹטֶנְצְיָאל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְשֵׂעָר מְקֻרְזָל שֶׁבַּגּוּף</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְקָרַחַת - בְּרֹאשׁ אִינְטֵלֶקְטוּאָל.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָרִאשׁוֹנִים שֶׁזִּהוּ אֶת הַטְּרֵנְד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָיוּ הָעוֹתְ'מָאנִים הַטּוּרְקִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שָׁנִים הֵם קוֹטְפִים דִּיבִידֵנְד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵהַשְׁתָּלַת שֵׂעָר לִמְרוּטִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קוֹצְרִים בְּאִבְחָה חַדָּה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֵׂעָר אֵיכוּתִי מֵהַגַּבַּחַת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זוֹרְעִים אוֹתוֹ בְּדִמְעָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁיִּנְבֹּט מֵחָדָשׁ בָּקָרַחַת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְכָךְ, מִכָּל אַגַּן הַיָּם הַתִּיכוֹן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּמֵאֶרֶץ חֶמְדַּת אָבוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">טָסוּ (עִם דַּרְכּוֹן) עָשִׁיר וְאֶבְיוֹן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְשָׁבוּ עִם שֵׂעָר עָבוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְכָל עִיר, רְחוֹב אוֹ כְּפָר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צָצוּ מְכוֹנֵי לֶיְזֶר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהִצִּיעוּ לְכָל גְּבַרְבַּר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יָד מוּשֶׁטֶת לְעֵזֶר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֹפִי, בְּפִזּוּז קֶרֶן קַלָּה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תּוּכַל לְהָסִיר אֶת הַפְּקַעַת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֲקָלָה תּוֹךְ שָׁעָה קַלָּה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בִּרְכוֹתֵינוּ, הָפַכְתָּ לִדְלַעַת...</span></p>"
}
